WEBVTT

00:00.480 --> 00:03.360
Then I'll speak directly.

00:04.720 --> 00:10.200
I hope you'll go to Qingzhou to organize reforms change the original land tax system from taxing by headcount.

00:10.280 --> 00:14.360
To taxing by land in this way those with more land pay more tax.

00:14.440 --> 00:17.960
Those with less land pay less tax qingzhou.

00:18.760 --> 00:21.480
That is lady Chen's hometown.

00:23.240 --> 00:27.480
Precisely because it's her family's place that's why we should use Qingzhou as a pilot.

00:27.560 --> 00:30.227
To set an example for the whole country.

00:33.320 --> 00:36.160
Look what Sheng'er wrote.

00:39.520 --> 00:44.227
Although there are still many areas needing improvement I think you can help him perfect it.

00:44.920 --> 00:49.080
You're his uncle this matter I only trust you.

00:49.920 --> 00:51.320
I.

00:52.200 --> 00:53.600
Understand.

00:54.560 --> 00:57.400
I accept the order.

